## Spread Operator
The `...` operator spreads an array or object into individual elements:

### Arrays:
```ts
const a = [1, 2, 3];
const b = [0, ...a, 4];  // [0, 1, 2, 3, 4]
```

### Objects:
```ts
const video = { title: "Cat", views: 100 };
const updated = { ...video, views: 200 };
// { title: "Cat", views: 200 }
```
Later properties override earlier ones.

## Rest Parameters
`...` in function parameters collects remaining arguments into an array:
```ts
function sum(...nums: number[]): number {
    let total = 0;
    for (const n of nums) total += n;
    return total;
}
sum(1, 2, 3);     // 6
sum(10, 20);       // 30
```


