## Assignment:
1. Create a `baseVideo` object with `title: "Original"` and `views: 0`
2. Create `viral` by spreading `baseVideo` and overriding `views` to `1000000`
3. Write a function `totalViews` that takes any number of view counts using rest params and returns the sum
4. Print `viral.title`, `viral.views`, and `totalViews(100, 200, 300)`
